      "text": "How I made over $1,000 in a month from AI - mostly while playing games and hanging out in group chats\n\nNo courses. No \"secret strategy.\" Just networking plus AI tools\n\nHere is what actually works\n\nThe foundation is not skill - it is networking\n\nClients do not find you on freelance platforms. They find a friend who \"knows AI\"\n\nIf five to ten people know you can solve their problem with AI, sooner or later someone reaches out\n\nContent automation for a niche\n\nBuilt a Claude pipeline for a client to auto-generate content for Polymarket:\n\nauto topic discovery plus fact research plus writing that sounds human\nan idea generator that finds the \"virality gap\" - topics nobody has covered yet\n\nPosts went out with zero editing and pulled in 40k to 200k-plus views\n\nThat alone brought in $1,000-plus\n\nA personal AI agent for a business owner\n\nThe client did not want an abstract product. He wanted his actual daily headaches solved\n\nBuilt an agent with:\n\na real personality, ready to run with zero server hassle for the client\nTelegram integration through an MCP server\na custom RAG setup on LlamaIndex for the team\n\nOne agent like this covered a month of rent\n\nVibe-coding, done end to end\n\nWebsites, bots, platforms - without writing code by hand\n\nI know a web designer who used AI to cover skills outside his expertise and turned it into a real business\n\nMedia is the most underrated channel\n\nMade a couple videos about Claude code and VPNs - grew from almost nothing to 200-plus subscribers off two videos\n\nOne video with a QR code on screen brought in 100-plus Telegram subscribers\n\nAll the videos were made with Claude code\n\nThe market is not saturated yet and demand is high while the barrier to entry is low\n\nYou do not need to be a programmer. You need to show what you can actually solve with AI\n\nSave this if you have been wanting to start but did not know where\n\nhttps://t.co/D3Z45WlPIc",
